- [Art] Shit!

824
00:43:18.708 --> 00:43:21.333
- You have to hold her from behind.
- [Jack] You're gonna be okay.

825
00:43:21.416 --> 00:43:23.958
Hold on. I'll get her a glass of water.

826
00:43:24.041 --> 00:43:25.750
- [Judy gagging]
- [Jack] Good. good.

827
00:43:25.833 --> 00:43:27.458
