854
00:45:04.291 --> 00:45:06.541
Well. my wife's dead.
I don't have a future.

855
00:45:06.625 --> 00:45:08.416
Yeah. but you're still here. buddy.

856
00:45:08.500 --> 00:45:10.083
What. in The Boroughs?

857
00:45:11.583 --> 00:45:13.333
God's waiting room?

858
